    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "H3hqZ6",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 100,
      "name": "polish spec · for approval",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 420,
      "content": "APPROVED 2026-09-15: top tab bar (this artboard's sibling, CHOSEN) replaces the left rail.\n\nBar: 34pt, fill #0f0f15, 1px bottom border (soft). Lights at native position, 12pt gap, then tabs.\nTabs: uniform 110pt, full bar height, square (no radius), 1px separators (soft) incl. leading edge of first tab. Icon 18pt (corner 5) + lowercase label 12px, left-anchored, 10pt inset, 6pt gap. Active: fill #1c2136, label fg, full-color icon, 2pt accent underline. Inactive: fill #16161e, label muted, icon desaturated (.saturation(0)) at 75%.\nDeck mini: far right, 18pt glyph + 7pt ok-green dot top-right with 2pt bar-color ring. Opens deck in the window. Not part of cmd-1..9.\nContent: full-bleed below the bar, no other chrome. cmd-1..9 by tab order, cmd-R reload, tooltips + right-click reload on tabs.\nThe old left-rail artboard above is superseded, kept for history."
    },
